                  "stats": {
                    "id": "levelled_description_6300401e8bd4",
                    "level": {
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "You can strong-arm people effectively, even when you don't have them isolated. When you Coerce, you can compare your Intimidation check result to the Will DCs of up to five targets instead of one.\n\nIt's possible to get a different degree of success for each target. The number of targets you can Coerce in a single action increases to 10 if you're an expert, 25 if you're a master, and 50 if you're legendary."
